## Quick commands

```bash
night-shift status       # Show last run status + next scheduled run
night-shift logs         # Tail latest log (default 50 lines)
night-shift run          # Trigger a manual run
night-shift run --dry-run  # Test run, no real artifacts shipped
night-shift apply <id>   # Apply a patch (partial id match works)
night-shift triage       # Last 7 runs status report
night-shift restore      # Roll back your project to last-night snapshot
night-shift help         # Full help
```

