## Editing my behavior

The agent's "brain" lives at `{{ install_dir }}/prompt.md`. Edit it directly to tune what I do, but be careful — major changes can break things.

For safer editing:
- Recipe behavior: edit YAML at `{{ install_dir }}/recipes/<name>.yaml`
- Permissions: edit `{{ install_dir }}/settings.json` (deny list is non-relaxable)
- Schedule: edit `~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.{{ user_short }}.night-shift-routine.plist` and reload (`launchctl bootout / bootstrap`)
- Wizard questions (for re-running setup): edit `~/.night-shift-installer/wizard-questions.yaml`

